The stimulation protocol is described in:

    Pinel, P., Thirion, B., Meriaux, S., Jobert, A., Serres, J.,
    Le Bihan, D., Poline, J.-B., & Dehaene, S. (2007). Fast reproducible
    identification and large-scale databasing of individual functional
    cognitive networks. BMC Neuroscience, 8, 91.
    https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-2202-8-91
